<title>PHILIPPINES: Centro Escolar sets six-peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Centro Escolar sets six-peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centro Escolar University said on Tuesday its board of directors approved a six-peso per share cash dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be given to stockholders on record as of July 30, 1997 and will be payable on August 15. The ex-date has been set on July 21.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
